Utility to check a params$eval (or param$eval) flag safely. Returns TRUE/FALSE depending on the parameter, and FALSE if the parameter is missing.

eval_ok &lt;- tryCatch(isTRUE(params$eval), error = function(...) {
  tryCatch(isTRUE(param$eval), error = function(...) FALSE)
})

